{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00199",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.52,
      "end_seconds": 1.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Hello, come through."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 2.65,
      "end_seconds": 3.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 5.08,
      "end_seconds": 9.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.32,
      "end_seconds": 16.03,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here. So, was parking alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.53,
      "end_seconds": 19.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Not great, I ended up a few streets away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.0,
      "end_seconds": 22.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "What's been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 23.78,
      "end_seconds": 25.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "He's been having trouble sleeping, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.12,
      "end_seconds": 29.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "How long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.83,
      "end_seconds": 38.73,
      "duration_seconds": 8.9,
      "text": "I mean, hm. It was either the end of last month or earlier than that. I couldn't tell you the date."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.94,
      "end_seconds": 41.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Mm. And how severe is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.67,
      "end_seconds": 48.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "Well, it's... hard to say, it's kind of... I don't know—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.39,
      "end_seconds": 53.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Take your time. Mild, moderate, or severe, if you had to pick?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.04,
      "end_seconds": 56.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Mild, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.32,
      "end_seconds": 60.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "And what do you do to cope with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.18,
      "end_seconds": 64.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Only a warm bath, and it's not much."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.06,
      "end_seconds": 71.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.95,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 71.11,
      "end_seconds": 75.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.06,
      "end_seconds": 78.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "I was getting to that!"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.48,
      "end_seconds": 85.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "That's fine, one at a time. I'll ask about everything. Have you been feeling exhausted in the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.21,
      "end_seconds": 87.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Yes, for four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 89.23,
      "end_seconds": 91.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Yes, exactly like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.33,
      "end_seconds": 95.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "So, I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.07,
      "end_seconds": 96.87,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.19,
      "end_seconds": 113.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Have you had any restless legs or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.59,
      "end_seconds": 123.82,
      "duration_seconds": 9.23,
      "text": "Right, no, no restless legs, no chest pain. I did have trouble concentrating at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.67,
      "end_seconds": 128.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Any snoring, night sweats or low mood at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.17,
      "end_seconds": 131.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.94,
      "end_seconds": 136.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.8,
      "end_seconds": 140.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, um, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.82,
      "end_seconds": 144.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.6,
      "end_seconds": 145.36,
      "duration_seconds": 0.76,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.53,
      "end_seconds": 159.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Okay, here we go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 160.62,
      "end_seconds": 169.8,
      "duration_seconds": 9.18,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Saturation 99 percent, pulse 69, blood pressure 109 over 68, temperature is 36.6 degrees, respiratory rate 15."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.98,
      "end_seconds": 175.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Okay, noted. Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.74,
      "end_seconds": 179.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "I hadn't even noticed, um, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.76,
      "end_seconds": 185.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.65,
      "end_seconds": 196.47,
      "duration_seconds": 6.82,
      "text": "Hmm, I've had anxiety, yes. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.26,
      "end_seconds": 197.96,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Mm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.41,
      "end_seconds": 210.2,
      "duration_seconds": 10.79,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for about a year. Okay, uh, so I have an enlarged prostate, for about ten years. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.23,
      "end_seconds": 218.61,
      "duration_seconds": 7.38,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known anxiety. We'll keep that in mind today. Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.22,
      "end_seconds": 220.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.85,
      "end_seconds": 224.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.98,
      "end_seconds": 228.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "My father had kidney stones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.42,
      "end_seconds": 243.08,
      "duration_seconds": 14.66,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.0,
      "end_seconds": 245.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.32,
      "end_seconds": 250.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.57,
      "end_seconds": 254.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Yes, pollen, it gives me a runny nose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.28,
      "end_seconds": 259.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.01,
      "end_seconds": 271.42,
      "duration_seconds": 11.41,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.84,
      "end_seconds": 273.82,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.88,
      "end_seconds": 278.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "I gave up drinking about three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.97,
      "end_seconds": 282.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Do you need me to explain anything as we go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.17,
      "end_seconds": 289.24,
      "duration_seconds": 6.07,
      "text": "Just tell me in plain language, please. I'm not good with the medical terms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.77,
      "end_seconds": 294.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.79,
      "end_seconds": 299.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Uh, I'm on amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once a day for my pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 300.57,
      "end_seconds": 304.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 10 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.25,
      "end_seconds": 310.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Right. Do you happen to have the current prescription here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.19,
      "end_seconds": 319.8,
      "duration_seconds": 8.61,
      "text": "Yeah, uh, I don't think I have it with me. I was on telmisartan before. I stopped taking it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.12,
      "end_seconds": 325.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.88,
      "end_seconds": 337.73,
      "duration_seconds": 10.85,
      "text": "Uh, yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.17,
      "end_seconds": 340.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.33,
      "end_seconds": 344.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.48,
      "end_seconds": 361.38,
      "duration_seconds": 15.9,
      "text": "Putting together what you've described, my working impression is insomnia, probably stress-related. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I'd also keep a thyroid problem in mind. Sleep apnoea is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 362.13,
      "end_seconds": 364.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Is it something serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.02,
      "end_seconds": 380.86,
      "duration_seconds": 14.84,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with insomnia, probably stress-related do well once it's treated properly. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had trouble sleeping, mild, and no snoring or night sweats."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 383.14,
      "end_seconds": 384.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.29,
      "end_seconds": 394.42,
      "duration_seconds": 9.13,
      "text": "I'm going to order a thyroid test, for insomnia. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 394.84,
      "end_seconds": 397.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "So, alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 400.85,
      "end_seconds": 423.65,
      "duration_seconds": 22.8,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a sleep study for insomnia. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. Same wake-up time every day, no screens in the hour before bed, and no coffee after lunch. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 425.24,
      "end_seconds": 426.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0071",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 427.77,
      "end_seconds": 433.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0072",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 434.8,
      "end_seconds": 436.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0073",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 437.8,
      "end_seconds": 440.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Please come and see me in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0074",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 442.17,
      "end_seconds": 443.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0075",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 444.76,
      "end_seconds": 451.05,
      "duration_seconds": 6.29,
      "text": "Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0076",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 452.3,
      "end_seconds": 456.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "So, I come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0077",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 457.1,
      "end_seconds": 461.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0078",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 462.05,
      "end_seconds": 464.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Thank you. I'll see you then."
